---
import SiteNavigation from '../components/SiteNavigation.astro';
import branding from '../data/branding.json';
interface Props { title?: string }
const { title = '해인교회' } = Astro.props;
---
<html lang="ko">
 <head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href={branding.logo}/>
  <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator}/>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive"/>
  <meta name="description" content="하나님을 사랑하고 이웃을 섬기는 인천 해인교회. 교회소개, 예배안내, 말씀과 주보, 교육과 선교사역을 만나세요."/>
  <title>{title}</title>
  <style is:global>
   .live-page{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:3rem 1.5rem 5rem}.live-body{white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.9;margin:1.5rem 0}.live-media{margin:1.5rem 0}.live-media img,.live-media video{display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:650px;margin:1rem auto}.live-media audio{max-width:100%}.live-media a,.live-menu-link{display:block;color:#245d89;padding:.8rem;background:#f2f6fa;border-radius:5px;margin:.6rem 0}.live-new-posts{list-style:none;margin-bottom:2rem}.live-new-posts a{display:block;padding:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #dce5ed;color:#315c7c}
   *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{font-family:'맑은 고딕',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#26364a;background:#fff}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}img{max-width:100%}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}a,button,summary,input{touch-action:manipulation}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ae7939;outline-offset:4px}main{min-height:40vh}body{overflow-wrap:break-word}[hidden]{display:none!important}
  </style>
 </head>
 <body>
  <a class="skip" href="#main-content">본문 바로가기</a>
  <SiteNavigation/>
  <div id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><slot/></div>
  <script>import '../lib/live-site';</script>
  <footer>
   <div class="footer-inner"><div><p class="footer-name"><img src={branding.logo} alt={branding.alt} width={branding.width} height={branding.height} loading="lazy"/></p><p>하나님을 사랑하고 이웃을 섬기는 교회</p><p>21041 인천 계양구 계양산로 91 (계산동)</p><a href="tel:0325557004">032-555-7004</a></div>
   <nav aria-label="하단 메뉴"><a href="/services/">예배안내</a><a href="/contact/">오시는 길</a><a href="/boards/">전체 메뉴·검색</a><a href="/admin/">관리자</a></nav></div>
   <p class="copyright">© {new Date().getFullYear()} 해인교회. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>
 </body>
</html>
<style>
 .footer-name img{display:block;background:#fff;border:5px solid #fff;border-radius:4px;box-sizing:content-box;width:220px;height:auto}
 .skip{position:fixed;left:1rem;top:-100px;z-index:999;background:#193e65;color:#fff;padding:1rem}.skip:focus{top:1rem}footer{background:#182f49;color:#c2cedc;font-size:.85rem;padding:3rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;line-height:2}.footer-inner{max-width:1152px;margin:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem}.footer-name{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.6rem}.footer-inner nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem;align-content:start}footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.copyright{max-width:1152px;margin:2rem auto 0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff20;padding-top:1rem;font-size:.75rem}@media(max-width:650px){.footer-inner{flex-direction:column}.footer-inner nav{gap:1rem}}
</style>
